347 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ([1] Service income recovery: Following market headwinds, we anticipate a steady revival in bancassurance fees as consumer confidence returns. Simultaneously, card fees and transaction banking services are set to accelerate, leveraging the cross-selling opportunities within the expanding corporate client base.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [12]
>>
