395 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Examining ACB's historical P/B dynamics and intrinsic fundamentals, we observe a positive correlation between P/B and Loan Loss Reserve \(LLR\) coverage ratio \(excluding abnormal equity market periods: 2017-2018 IPO-driven banking sector inflows and 2020-2021 COVID-19 pandemic\). Over the past years, LLR ratio movements have exhibited a lag relative to P/B movements, suggesting ACB's valuation tends to anticipate changes in asset quality ahead of actual provisioning. Notably, P/B has shown no clear correlation with ROAE since 2018, despite profitability being a fundamental determinant of fair valuation for ACB and the banking sector broadly.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
